Positive Behavioral Change: To reduce inflammatory joint stiffness, perform five minutes of slow, active range-of-motion exercises in a hot shower every morning; utilizing the ambient heat will increase local joint perfusion and mechanically decrease the morning stiffness.
Home-Based Services: None indicated tonight.
